# X. Future Architecture

Future development may introduce specialized AI components while preserving the same authorization and knowledge boundaries.

A possible high-level direction is:

```text
                         User
                           │
                           ▼
                    Orchestrator
                           │
             ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
             ▼             ▼             ▼
         Retrieval      Document      Verification
           Agent        Agent           Agent
             │             │             │
             └─────────────┼─────────────┘
                           ▼
                    Authorization
                           │
                           ▼
                    Approved Context
                           │
                           ▼
                    Response Layer
```

Potential specialized responsibilities include:

- Knowledge retrieval
- Document processing
- Knowledge organization
- Administrative workflows
- Response verification

This represents a future architectural direction rather than a claim that every component is currently implemented.

The authorization boundary remains central regardless of how the AI components evolve.

